---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { buildSchema } from '../../lib/schemas';

const schema = buildSchema.expertWitnessHub();
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Communications Expert — Dr. Tal Lavian, Ph.D."
  description="Communications expert for patent litigation: telecommunications, VoIP, internet, networking. Dr. Tal Lavian, Ph.D. UC Berkeley, 120+ patents, 90+ cases."
  schema={schema}
  ogImage="/images/og/communications-expert-witness.jpg"
>
  <div class="hero-banner">
    <h1>Dr. Tal Lavian, Ph.D.: Communications Technology Expertise for Patent Litigation</h1>
    <div class="hero-stats">
      <div class="hero-stat">
        <div class="hero-stat-number">Ph.D.</div>
        <div class="hero-stat-label">UC Berkeley</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-stat">
        <div class="hero-stat-number">120+</div>
        <div class="hero-stat-label">Invented Patents</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-stat">
        <div class="hero-stat-number">60+</div>
        <div class="hero-stat-label">Patents Prosecuted Pro Se</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-stat">
        <div class="hero-stat-number">25+</div>
        <div class="hero-stat-label">Publications</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-stat">
        <div class="hero-stat-number">35+</div>
        <div class="hero-stat-label">Years Experience</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-stat">
        <div class="hero-stat-number">3</div>
        <div class="hero-stat-label">DARPA Projects as Principal Investigator</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="content-full">
        <p>Dr. Tal Lavian is a <a href="/communications-expert-witness/telecommunications-expert-witness/">telecommunications expert</a> with a Ph.D. from UC Berkeley, where he spent nearly 20 years researching, studying, and lecturing. He has filed declarations in more than 90 PTAB proceedings (IPR and CBM). He provides expert reports, claim construction analysis, and deposition and trial testimony in patent cases involving the technologies below.</p>

        <!-- Credential trust bar (approved figures; one item set sitewide) -->
        <div class="credential-bar" role="group" aria-label="Dr. Lavian's credentials">
          <span class="cred-item"><span class="cred-num">Ph.D.</span> <a href="/about-dr-lavian/">UC Berkeley</a></span>
          <span class="cred-item"><span class="cred-num">120+</span> <a href="/patents/">Invented Patents</a></span>
          <span class="cred-item"><span class="cred-num">100+</span> Patents Litigated</span>
          <span class="cred-item"><span class="cred-num">90+</span> <a href="/cases-expert-witness-testimony/">Cases</a></span>
          <span class="cred-item"><span class="cred-num">60+</span> Depositions</span>
          <span class="cred-item"><span class="cred-num">25+</span> <a href="/scientific-publications/">Publications</a></span>
          <span class="cred-item"><span class="cred-num">35+</span> Years Experience</span>
          <span class="cred-item"><span class="cred-num">50+</span> Law Firms &amp; Corporate Clients</span>
          <div class="cred-companies">Retained by attorneys at Fish &amp; Richardson, Kirkland &amp; Ellis, Gibson Dunn, Finnegan, Irell &amp; Manella, Skadden, and other firms, in cases involving Apple, Google, Microsoft, Cisco, and others.</div>
        </div>

        <h2>Technology Areas</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong><a href="/communications-expert-witness/telecommunications-expert-witness/">Telecommunications</a></strong>: PSTN, VoIP, signaling protocols, and telecom infrastructure.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/communications-expert-witness/pstn-voip-expert-witness/">PSTN and VoIP Systems</a></strong>: Circuit switching, SS7 signaling, SONET/SDH, and SIP/RTP VoIP.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/communications-expert-witness/network-communications-expert-witness/">Network Communications</a></strong>: Packet switching, protocol stacks, network interfaces, and quality of service; the specialty of his Ph.D.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/communications-expert-witness/internet-expert-witness/">Internet and TCP/IP</a></strong>: TCP/IP, UDP, IPv4/IPv6, DNS, DHCP, ARP, and HTTP.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/communications-expert-witness/voice-over-ip-voip-expert/">Voice over IP</a></strong>: SIP, RTP, and IP telephony systems.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/communications-expert-witness/routing-switching-expert-witness/">Routing and Switching</a></strong>: MPLS, BGP, OSPF, and L2/L3 switching architectures; router and switch design at Nortel Networks.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/communications-expert-witness/computer-networking-expert-witness/">Computer Networking</a></strong>: LAN and WAN architectures, Ethernet (IEEE 802.3), routers, switches, and gateways.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/communications-expert-witness/data-communications-expert-witness/">Data Communications</a></strong>: Data transmission; IEEE and IETF RFC standards.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/communications-expert-witness/networking-expert-witness/">Networking</a></strong>: Enterprise network architectures.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/communications-expert-witness/network-management-expert-witness/">Network Management</a></strong>: NMS, SNMP, MIB structures, and Operational Support Systems (OSS).</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/communications-expert-witness/network-security-expert-witness/">Network Security</a></strong>: Firewalls, VPN, SSL/TLS, IPsec, and secure multimedia communications.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/communications-expert-witness/streaming-media-expert-witness/">Streaming Media</a></strong>: Video and audio streaming, multimedia conferencing, RTP/RTCP.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/communications-expert-witness/mobile-wireless-expert-witness/">Mobile and Wireless</a></strong>: Wi-Fi 802.11, WLAN, wireless access technologies, and mobile devices.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/communications-expert-witness/messaging-and-chat-expert-witness/">Messaging and Chat</a></strong>: SMS, MMS, instant messaging, and chat applications.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Testimony and Reports</h2>
        <p>Dr. Lavian has testified in court cases before judges and juries in U.S. federal and state courts, the Canadian Federal Court, and a court in Malaysia, and has given declarations and testimony in USPTO PTAB proceedings. He has been retained in ITC Section 337 investigations, has given <a href="/cases-expert-witness-testimony/">60+ depositions</a>, and has written expert reports on claim construction, infringement, invalidity, and prior art. He presents technical material in plain terms for technical and lay audiences. Remote deposition and trial testimony are available.</p>

        <h2>Examples of Matter Subjects</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Web reservation over the Internet covering multiple reservation instances.</li>
          <li>Network management, OSS, SNMP, and device management, including IP-PBX management.</li>
          <li>Telecommunications architecture, PSTN, and VoIP.</li>
          <li>Network protocol for a multimedia application.</li>
          <li>Router switching fabric architecture and Ethernet pseudo-wire VPN.</li>
          <li>MPLS tunneling and IETF RFC standards for MPLS.</li>
          <li>Wi-Fi 802.11 and WLAN, including Wi-Fi 802.11 tethering.</li>
          <li>iPhone, iPad, and other Apple mobile wireless products.</li>
          <li>Short message service (SMS) and chat application patents.</li>
          <li>Firewall and secure multimedia communications.</li>
          <li>Video conference application programs.</li>
        </ul>

    <aside class="court-quote" aria-label="Federal Circuit opinion referring to Dr. Lavian's testimony">
          <h2>Federal Circuit Opinion Referring to Dr. Lavian&rsquo;s Testimony</h2>
          <blockquote>
            <p>&ldquo;Furthermore, the Board credited the testimony of petitioner&rsquo;s expert, Dr. Lavian, who testified that Clark&rsquo;s stated goal of organization of electronic messages would have provided motivation for a skilled artisan to combine the message database of Clark into Zydney&rsquo;s software.&rdquo;</p>
          </blockquote>
          <p class="court-cite"><em>Uniloc 2017 LLC v. Facebook Inc.</em>, 989 F.3d 1018 (Fed. Cir. 2021) &mdash; <a href="https://www.courtlistener.com/opinion/4862180/uniloc-2017-llc-v-facebook-inc/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">full opinion on CourtListener</a>.</p>
        </aside>

        <!-- FAQ Section -->
        <section class="faq-section" aria-label="Frequently asked questions about Dr. Lavian">
          <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

          <details open>
            <summary>What does Dr. Lavian provide in a matter?</summary>
            <p>Expert reports, claim construction analysis, technical tutorials, deposition and trial testimony, prior art investigation, and patent portfolio evaluation in telecommunications and networking matters.</p>
          </details>

          <details>
            <summary>What are Dr. Lavian&rsquo;s qualifications?</summary>
            <p>A Ph.D. in Computer Science from UC Berkeley specializing in network communications; nearly 20 years researching, studying, and lecturing at UC Berkeley; 120+ invented patents; 90+ cases, 60+ depositions, and 100+ patents litigated; 25+ scientific publications; over 35 years of experience. He is an IEEE Senior Member.</p>
          </details>

          <details>
            <summary>Which law firms have retained Dr. Lavian?</summary>
            <p>Over 50 law firms and corporate clients, including Fish &amp; Richardson, Kirkland &amp; Ellis, Gibson Dunn, Skadden, Finnegan, Irell &amp; Manella, Perkins Coie, Morgan Lewis, and Baker Botts. See <a href="/law-firm-clients/">law firm clients</a>.</p>
          </details>
        </section>

        <aside class="cta-block" aria-label="Contact Dr. Lavian">
          <h2>Contact Dr. Lavian About a Matter</h2>
          <p>To discuss a matter, call <a href="tel:+14082099112">+1 (408) 209-9112</a> or email <!--email_off--><a href="mailto:tlavian@telecommnet.com">tlavian@telecommnet.com</a><!--/email_off-->. Dr. Lavian is based in Encino, California and is available for engagements nationwide.</p>
          <p class="cta-links"><a class="cta-button" href="/contact/">Contact Dr. Lavian</a> <a class="cta-link" href="/Dr-Tal-Lavian-CV-Expert-Witness-Network-Communications-Telecommunications-Internet-Protocols-Mobile-Wireless-2026.pdf">Curriculum Vitae (PDF)</a></p>
        </aside>

    </div>
  </div>

<style is:global>
  .testimony-box {
    background: #f0f4f8;
    padding: 25px;
    margin: 20px 0;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .testimony-box ul ul {
    list-style-type: circle;
  }
</style>

</BaseLayout>
